cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this hardware, please cite it as below."
title: "SpaceCup (AMMITY): an open-source menstrual cup that seals before extraction, for menstruation in reduced gravity"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, cast-silicone menstrual cup for menstruation in reduced
  gravity, designed on a shared base geometry across seven closing
  mechanisms. Flower Low and Flower High scored highest in bench testing
  (24/25), and Flower Low was flown during the Asclepios VI parabolic-flight
  campaign. This is a research prototype, not a certified medical device.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
